SUMMARY:Bronte Historical Society Speaker
DESCRIPTION:Searching for your roots? Discover your past and preserve your family’s story. Please join us! GENEALOGIST Coral Harkies is coming to speak to Bronte Historical Society. \nJuly 7th\, 2026\nSovereign House\n7:00 PM \nFree Parking is available adjacent to Sovereign House\, 7 West River St. \nRegister by email: \nhistorian@brontehistoricalsociety.ca\nCall the House: (905) 825-5552
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/bronte-historical-society-speaker/
LOCATION:Sovereign House\, 7 West River Street\, Oakville\, ON\, L6L 6N9\, Canada
END:VEVENT
